                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more kawaii"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a4b5e630-245e-4a1d-9a79-69f529f1b103",
                        "entry_id": "1449e254-2e65-35a9-9ca5-bb953a5ea646",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most kawaii"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c1e8815d-f911-35e9-8e9f-98fe96f3ba04",
                        "entry_id": "1449e254-2e65-35a9-9ca5-bb953a5ea646",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cute, adorable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in the context of Japanese culture"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a960360-1043-479f-88cb-dde4d14d5cd5",
                                "sense_id": "c1e8815d-f911-35e9-8e9f-98fe96f3ba04",
                                "text": "She bought a kawaii keychain shaped like a kitten."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48b29d08-eff1-47cf-b5ba-7de5ad2c5f5a",
                                "sense_id": "c1e8815d-f911-35e9-8e9f-98fe96f3ba04",
                                "text": "However, Wong's connection to kawaii culture, which I have attempted to establish here, suggests a different reading of his films. As Larissa Hjorth has argued, “The kawaii is not about post-humanism but rather a clear demonstration of neo-humanist types” (144). In this sense, East Asian kawaii culture, like Wong's films, should be understood as desperate attempts to create a dreamlike humanist space within the harsh reality of globalized capitalism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed0b790e-5fe6-436b-9b0a-162979891c69",
                                "sense_id": "c1e8815d-f911-35e9-8e9f-98fe96f3ba04",
                                "text": "The female has been reduced to a manageable, nonthreatening form. As we've mentioned, the cyborgs are depicted with typically kawaii features, such as disproportionately large eyes and heads, and thin bodies. Each girl is dressed by her handler in keeping with a particular style. For example, Triela often wears a masculine pants suit […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c883aa4-e483-44ee-a8b7-d046dcc263ef",
                                "sense_id": "c1e8815d-f911-35e9-8e9f-98fe96f3ba04",
                                "text": "In the advanced information society of the 21st century with its communication infrastructure of computers and networks, it is crucial to enhance software that utilizes these technologies, that is, digital content. Among such content, various Japanese kawaii characters such as Hello Kitty and Pokemon have become […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2ce4d931-728a-4063-a879-0f7729466362",
                        "source_entry_id": "1449e254-2e65-35a9-9ca5-bb953a5ea646",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1e8815d-f911-35e9-8e9f-98fe96f3ba04",
                        "source_sense_description": "cute, in the context of Japanese culture",
                        "target_lang_word": "kawaï",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kawaï",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16d8c2d3-501d-35c0-a973-e475833d637f",
                                        "entry_id": "c90ef87d-8dde-3542-8ceb-d31e50697f3d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Variante orthographique de kawaii. Mignon, spécialement en parlant de la pop culture japonaise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b4b238c-9c44-44dd-857d-056be3399d07",
                                                "sense_id": "16d8c2d3-501d-35c0-a973-e475833d637f",
                                                "text": "Vous le savez, je suis une Kitty addict, rien donc d’étonnant que dès que je suis à vue d’une moustache so kawaï du petit chat japonais, je sois en ébullition."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88603c9e-824d-48c7-889e-58a4fd242d8f",
                                                "sense_id": "16d8c2d3-501d-35c0-a973-e475833d637f",
                                                "text": "Assez kawaï, le cake à la rose barbie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d05c78a-0597-4065-ad2c-8ceefd54ac64",
                        "source_entry_id": "1449e254-2e65-35a9-9ca5-bb953a5ea646",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1e8815d-f911-35e9-8e9f-98fe96f3ba04",
                        "source_sense_description": "cute, in the context of Japanese culture",
                        "target_lang_word": "kawaii",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kawaii",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13f3031b-f797-3e3b-8e5d-19ffc498f5ad",
                                        "entry_id": "b2930cc5-06e7-3759-8363-c980b8f912c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mignon, spécialement en parlant de la pop culture japonaise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26daf1bf-37d4-4604-9155-110c968cc95a",
                                                "sense_id": "13f3031b-f797-3e3b-8e5d-19ffc498f5ad",
                                                "text": "Pour dessiner un chat kawaii, on ne dessine pas les yeux tels qu’ils sont dans la réalité ! Selon leur forme, ils expriment un caractère ou une émotion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2521588-2bc6-4fdc-ac14-26852fe60a67",
                                                "sense_id": "13f3031b-f797-3e3b-8e5d-19ffc498f5ad",
                                                "text": "Aux yeux des plus jeunes, – et cela relève tout autant du stéréotype – le pays des mangas, des jeux vidéos et de l’esthétique kawaii apparaît comme un univers de science-fiction et suscite une admiration béate."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d14460c8-b791-4e43-93bd-f33bc48f821f",
                                                "sense_id": "13f3031b-f797-3e3b-8e5d-19ffc498f5ad",
                                                "text": "Cette provocation extrême est une exception car la jeune fille ou la jeune femme kawaii, si elle est exubérante, n’est pas indécente et elle n’est jamais vulgaire comme dans de nombreuses publicités en Europe ou aux États-Unis. Les comportements kawaii ne sont pas franchement sexuels et il convient de dire ici quelques mots des garçons. Ils raffolent des coiffures en cactus extrêmement pointues. Leur masculinité est peu prononcée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
